{"content":"\n<figure><img width=\"480\" height=\"360\" src=\"http://penakkal.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/118028611_162069902208468_2600783313191640221_n.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>The oldest surviving photo from #Hajj,<br />year 1880!</p>\n\n\n\n<p>In the back, you can see one of the hotels built by the <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/ottoman?source=feed_text&amp;epa=HASHTAG&amp;__xts__%5B0%5D=68.ARDKiOwYAtChr2aE2cNafGkmULLNue2n_cZmnP49l3k4fUabE-aZZntJ-L1WU1qDW1lr23wpEQiQd07quK49M-pZVM2HdHFdzzLUK0Qu1sBrWE7jDAR9VTuqN2cielPoH2xXnapHP4LULK6zncDSVgn7201Mt_-8tbZZVgPZ3vH7M3dvcRY-PBKVhNLf5LcYZJIseBHByvFAxnRR_hVBV_UnO4SosEyD0-6A3dEcRBBNTgeTpjf-WXF-2Y9JZk_DSdOxzgn7qS1IUYOrdeZPWC_o_BZtA-IM4XEcaQjYNgGis6zyYCegl0SJU2OZnZFigRbAYhX0TFRJsnx6aRQZJhE&amp;__tn__=%2ANK-R\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#Ottoman</a> empire, which offers accommodation for <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/hajj?source=feed_text&amp;epa=HASHTAG&amp;__xts__%5B0%5D=68.ARDKiOwYAtChr2aE2cNafGkmULLNue2n_cZmnP49l3k4fUabE-aZZntJ-L1WU1qDW1lr23wpEQiQd07quK49M-pZVM2HdHFdzzLUK0Qu1sBrWE7jDAR9VTuqN2cielPoH2xXnapHP4LULK6zncDSVgn7201Mt_-8tbZZVgPZ3vH7M3dvcRY-PBKVhNLf5LcYZJIseBHByvFAxnRR_hVBV_UnO4SosEyD0-6A3dEcRBBNTgeTpjf-WXF-2Y9JZk_DSdOxzgn7qS1IUYOrdeZPWC_o_BZtA-IM4XEcaQjYNgGis6zyYCegl0SJU2OZnZFigRbAYhX0TFRJsnx6aRQZJhE&amp;__tn__=%2ANK-R\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#Hajj</a> for FREE!</p>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/hajj2018?source=feed_text&amp;epa=HASHTAG&amp;__xts__%5B0%5D=68.ARDKiOwYAtChr2aE2cNafGkmULLNue2n_cZmnP49l3k4fUabE-aZZntJ-L1WU1qDW1lr23wpEQiQd07quK49M-pZVM2HdHFdzzLUK0Qu1sBrWE7jDAR9VTuqN2cielPoH2xXnapHP4LULK6zncDSVgn7201Mt_-8tbZZVgPZ3vH7M3dvcRY-PBKVhNLf5LcYZJIseBHByvFAxnRR_hVBV_UnO4SosEyD0-6A3dEcRBBNTgeTpjf-WXF-2Y9JZk_DSdOxzgn7qS1IUYOrdeZPWC_o_BZtA-IM4XEcaQjYNgGis6zyYCegl0SJU2OZnZFigRbAYhX0TFRJsnx6aRQZJhE&amp;__tn__=%2ANK-R\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#Hajj2018</a></p>\n\n\n\n<p><